# React

- Functional components + TypeScript only. Features in `web/src/features/`; shared UI in `components/ui/`.
- Extract custom hooks for reusable state/effects; keep components mostly presentational.
- Colocate feature types and helpers under the feature folder; avoid cross-feature imports unless through shared layers.

```tsx
// ❌ feature importing another feature's internals
import { ResolveGridToolbar } from "../resolve/ResolveGridToolbar";

// ✅ shared primitive or explicit public export from feature index
import { DataGridToolbar } from "@/components/grid/DataGridToolbar";
```

- Destructive file ops: **dry-run preview → explicit user approval → apply**. Never one undifferentiated “실행” button.
- Korean UI copy; verb labels; status text includes the next action (see DESIGN.md).
